    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes of Anirea</strong> is a tactical, turn-based roguelite where every run tells a unique story in the fantastic world of Anirea. Lead a party of powerful heroes through a world torn by elemental forces, mastering a deep combat system that rewards smart positioning, ability synergy, and bold tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team from a diverse cast of heroes, each with unique skills and elemental affinities. Make your way through differente biomes, face a larger number of different enemies, and adapt your strategy as new challenges\u2014and opportunities\u2014emerge. Between runs, unlock permanent upgrades and discover hidden lore that deepens your connection to the world of Anirea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you crave challenging battles, compelling heroes, or the thrill of roguelite progression, <strong>Heroes of Anirea</strong> offers a tactical adventure where no two journeys are the same.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes of Anirea</strong> is a tactical, turn-based roguelite where every run tells a unique story in the fantastic world of Anirea. Lead a party of powerful heroes through a world torn by elemental forces, mastering a deep combat system that rewards smart positioning, ability synergy, and bold tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team from a diverse cast of heroes, each with unique skills and elemental affinities. Make your way through differente biomes, face a larger number of different enemies, and adapt your strategy as new challenges\u2014and opportunities\u2014emerge. Between runs, unlock permanent upgrades and discover hidden lore that deepens your connection to the world of Anirea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you crave challenging battles, compelling heroes, or the thrill of roguelite progression, <strong>Heroes of Anirea</strong> offers a tactical adventure where no two journeys are the same.</p>",
    "short_description": "Turn-based tactics meet roguelite progression in Heroes of Anirea \u2014 a character-driven strategy game. Build your team from a diverse cast of heroes and adapt your strategy as new challenges emerge.",
